sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Lib as 👩‍💼 Thủ thư
    participant Ctrl as LoanController
    participant Svc as CirculationAppService
    participant LoanAgg as Loan (Aggregate)
    participant FineStrat as IFineCalculationStrategy
    participant ResSvc as ReservationAppService
    participant UoW as IUnitOfWork & EventBus

    Lib->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/loans/{id}/return {barcode, conditionIn}
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl->>Svc: returnBooks(ReturnCommand)
    activate Svc

    Svc->>LoanAgg: returnItem(copyId, today, conditionIn)
    activate LoanAgg
    LoanAgg-->>Svc: loanItem (overdueDays, itemStatus)
    deactivate LoanAgg

    opt overdueDays > 0 HOẶC conditionIn == DAMAGED / LOST
        Svc->>FineStrat: calculateFine(loanItem, copy, overdueDays)
        FineStrat-->>Svc: fineAmount: Money
        Svc->>Svc: FineInvoice.issue(loanId, memberId, fineAmount)
        Svc->>Svc: member.addFineBalance(fineAmount)
    end

    alt conditionIn == GOOD và có hàng đợi Reservation
        Svc->>ResSvc: allocateReturnedCopy(bookTitleId, copyId)
        activate ResSvc
        ResSvc-->>Svc: reservation (READY_FOR_PICKUP, hold 48h)
        deactivate ResSvc
        Note right of ResSvc: BookCopy -> RESERVED<br/>Phát sự kiện gửi Email giữ sách
    else conditionIn == GOOD và không có người đặt chờ
        Svc->>Svc: copy.markReturned(GOOD) -> AVAILABLE (+1)
    else conditionIn == DAMAGED
        Svc->>Svc: copy.markMaintenance() -> MAINTENANCE
    end

    Svc->>LoanAgg: checkAllReturned() -> cập nhật CLOSED nếu đủ
    Svc->>UoW: commitTransaction() & publish(BookReturnedEvent)
    UoW-->>Svc: Committed OK
    Svc-->>Ctrl: ReturnReceiptDto (fineInvoice, nextReservation)
    Ctrl-->>Lib: HTTP 200 OK + JSON ReturnReceiptDto
    deactivate Svc
    deactivate Ctrl
